Package: sdidlab
Title: Specify, Run, Store and Plot Synthetic Difference-in-Differences Models
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Hodges", email = "jamesdavidhodges@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A workbench around the 'synthdid' estimator of Arkhangelsky,
    Athey, Hirshberg, Imbens and Wager (2021) <doi:10.1257/aer.20190159>,
    built for designs with a single treated unit. Adds trimmed placebo
    inference for when a heterogeneous donor pool inflates the placebo
    standard error, covariate residualisation on untreated cells, a
    bias-corrected synthetic control with permutation inference, and fit
    diagnostics that respect the level shift synthetic
    difference-in-differences absorbs.
